        "original_id": "5a4dfa2d-e8fc-5dce-b524-abef99412ffc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ricochet, The Bionic Woman\n- People: Russell Mulcahy, Denzel Washington, John Lithgow, Ice-T, Kevin Pollak, Lindsay Wagner, Jaime Sommers\n- Companies: Silver Pictures, Warner Bros., New Line Cinema\n- Topics: film distribution, television roles\n\nFacts:\n- The Bionic Woman is an American television series that ran from 1976 to 1978.\n- Lindsay Wagner is best known for portraying Jaime Sommers in The Bionic Woman.\n- Jaime Sommers is a leading female science fiction action character who undertakes high-risk government missions using superhuman bionic powers.\n- Ricochet is a 1991 American crime thriller film directed by Russell Mulcahy.\n- Ricochet stars Denzel Washington, John Lithgow, Ice-T, Kevin Pollak, and Lindsay Wagner.\n- Silver Pictures' movies after Ricochet were distributed by Warner Bros. and its subsidiary New Line Cinema.",
